CommandBase <|-- GiveCommand
CommandBase <|-- SpawnCommand
CommandBase <|-- ListCommand
CommandBase <|-- PlaceCommand
CommandBase <|-- PlantCommand
CommandBase <|-- FieldCommand
CommandBase <|-- CultivateCommand
CommandBase <|-- RepairCommand
CommandBase <|-- RefillCommand
CommandBase <|-- GroundLevelCommand
CommandBase <|-- PathCommand
CommandBase <|-- InspectCommand
CommandBase <|-- ScaleCommand
CommandBase <|-- CoordCommand
CommandBase <|-- HarvestCommand
CommandBase <|-- CheatStateCommand
CommandBase <|-- CheatInfoCommand
CommandBase <|-- HealCommand
CommandBase <|-- CleanseCommand
CommandBase <|-- BlessCommand
HarmEffect <|-- EarthquakeEffect
HarmEffect <|-- SlimeEffect
AttackCommand <|-- SpellShotCommand
CommandBase <|-- SpellsCommand
CommandBase <|-- TransformCommand
CommandBase <|-- HideBodyCommand
CommandBase <|-- KeybindsCommand
CommandBase <|-- KillMobsCommand
CommandBase <|-- VisualEffectCommand
CommandBase <|-- FxDumpCommand
CommandBase <|-- ShipCommand
CommandBase <|-- DomeCommand
DomeCommand ..> DomeWards : ward ZDOs
DomeCommand ..> DomeLayout : zone, lattice
DomePatches ..> DomeCommand : OnSpawned starts sync
DomeMenu ..> DomeCommand : Apply, MyGroups, ShowDomes
DomeCommand ..> DomePlayers : join history
DomeCommand ..> DomeNumbers : Group-N never reused
DomeCommand ..> DomeShow : test-aid domes
CommandBase <|-- DespawnCommand
AttackCommand <|-- TrapCommand
CommandBase <|-- TeleportCommand
AttackCommand <|-- BlinkCommand
TeleportMapPatch ..> TeleportCommand : armed map click
CommandBase <|-- ConstructCommand
ConstructCommand ..> BlueprintLibrary : blueprints (a folder = versions)
ConstructCommand ..> TerrainLevel : one TerrainOp per vertex
GroundLevelCommand ..> TerrainOps : one TerrainOp per vertex, report=1
PathCommand ..> TerrainOps : paint TerrainOp per stamp, report=1
ConstructCommand ..> FitField : ground under stone
ConstructCommand ..> PieceGhost : real piece size
ConstructCommand ..> MaterialSwap : families
ConstructPanel ..> ConstructCommand : op=construct forms
ConstructCommand ..> PreviewDoors : the plan's doors in the preview
BlueprintLibrary ..> Blueprint : parsed files
Blueprint *-- BlueprintPiece
DomeWards ..> WardState : Read, Write
DomeLayout ..> DomePoint : lattice spots
TrapCommand ..> TrapFxSet : blast looks
TrapCommand ..> TrapKind : kind table
TrapCommand ..> TrapWeapon : blast damage
TrapPatches ..> TrapCommand : OnSpawned starts watcher

FieldCommand ..> FieldAnchor
CultivateCommand ..> FieldAnchor
FieldCommand ..> CropSpacing
FieldCommand ..> FieldPatch : flood fill, area=patch
HarvestCommand ..> FieldPatch : Sample
FieldAnchor ..> KitAnchor : builds
PlantCommand ..> KitAnchor : AtAim
TransformCommand ..> TransformState : AddComponent (local player)
TransformForm <|-- RavenForm
TransformForm <|-- SerpentForm
TransformForm <|-- FishForm
TransformState --> TransformForm : the form of this cast
FieldCommand ..> GrowRules
PlantCommand ..> GrowRules
TransformCommand ..> TransformRemote : AddComponent (other players)
TransformState ..> TransformLanding : AddComponent
TransformCommand ..> TransformFallPatch : Patches.Apply (OnLoad)
TransformFallPatch ..> TransformCommand : Current (raven: fall damage 0)
HideBodyCommand ..> HideBodySendZdosPatch : Patches.Apply
HideBodyCommand ..> HideBodyPlayerListPatch : Patches.Apply
HideBodyCommand ..> HideBodySyncDataPatch : Patches.Apply
HideBodySendZdosPatch ..> HideBodyCommand : Current
KeybindsCommand ..> ConnectPanelKeyPatch : Patches.Apply
KeybindsCommand ..> KeyHintsF9Patch : Patches.Apply
KeybindsCommand ..> GameCameraF11Patch : Patches.Apply
KeybindsCommand ..> FejdStartupF11Patch : Patches.Apply
ConnectPanelKeyPatch ..> KeybindsCommand : Current
@enduml
